class: end-to-end
summary: D1323 D1115: an image linked with a developer's script that drops the derived script's eight unused bytes at the start of a writable region at address zero puts the datum placed there at zero, and breaks clause 5 of the firmware linker script contract, L0519, naming the datum; a stand-in driver writes the image the pinned Arm driver linked
constructs: 1650
targets: cortex-m0
expect: expected.txt
args: compile --root=../tests/fixtures/end-to-end/firmware-linker-script-places-at-zero/devices --target=cortex-m0 --firmware-entry=start --emit=exe --linker-script=../tests/fixtures/end-to-end/firmware-linker-script-places-at-zero/dev.ld --toolchain=../tests/fixtures/end-to-end/firmware-linker-script-places-at-zero/driver -o build/firmware-linker-script-places-at-zero.elf ../tests/fixtures/end-to-end/firmware-linker-script-places-at-zero/app
status: 1
